  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication and Visibility ofthe AGRI-CONNECT Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Ensure effective communication and visibility on the impact of EU&apos;s support to the agriculture sector through:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt; Strategic guidance and support in setting up and keeping the overall AGRI-CONNECT communication strategy. Enhanced integration of communication in all stages of the project cycle.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Increase effective communication and visibility of the EU as a key partner and global player, and to improve understanding of EU agriculture and natural resources cooperation and policies mainly in Tanzania but also in the EAC region at large.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Harmonisation of communication expressions and platforms used to promote the programme in Tanzania and the EAC agribusiness sector and among stakeholders. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
